# Blender autosaves
*.blend1

# Character source art (Blender / Tripo).
# Track only the hero masters and the Tripo gear inputs (which cost credits to
# regenerate). Ignore experimental dead-ends and huge one-off generations.
Characters/*
!Characters/Blaze_rigged.blend
!Characters/Blaze_final.blend
!Characters/Blaze_T-Pose.fbx
!Characters/blaze_mesh_2.fbx.glb
!Characters/*3d model*.glb
